.TH PDFANNEX-RESOLVER-DOCSTORE 1
.SH NAME
pdfannex-resolver-docstore \- resolve pdfannex sources from an HTTP docstore
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pdfannex-resolver-docstore
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pdfannex-resolver-docstore
implements Resolver Protocol 1 for the
.B docstore
scheme. It reads one JSON request from standard input and writes a JSON
response to standard output. It is normally invoked by the
.B pdfannex
CLI.
.SH CONFIGURATION
.TP
.B PDFANNEX_DOCSTORE_URL
Required base URL of the HTTP document service.
.TP
.B PDFANNEX_DOCSTORE_TOKEN
Optional bearer token.
.TP
.B PDFANNEX_DOCSTORE_TIMEOUT
Optional request timeout in seconds; defaults to 30.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Requires
.BR texlua (1)
and
.BR curl (1).
Curl must be available on
.BR PATH .
.SH SECURITY
Credentials are read from the environment and are not included in resolver
responses or the pdfannex lock file. The resolver does not follow HTTP
redirects.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pdfannex (1)
